	<!-- EN: A delegation of {1} knights from {0} turns up to test themselves against yours. They will hang around near your colony for a while. Select them and enter them in your next tournament while they are here, good for filling out the bracket. -->
  <RimJoust.DelegationArrivesText>来自{0}的{1}名骑士代表团前来与你的骑士一较高下。他们会在你的殖民地附近逗留一段时间。趁他们在这里时，选择他们并让他们参加你的下一次锦标赛，很适合填满参赛名单。</RimJoust.DelegationArrivesText>
	<!-- EN: Jousting tournaments -->
  <RimJoust.IntroLetterLabel>比武锦标赛</RimJoust.IntroLetterLabel>
	<!-- EN: How to hold a jousting tournament:\n\n1. Put a flag A and a flag B at each end of the lists, with a list barrier between them if you can.\n2. Mount your colonists (Giddy-Up). They get a jousting lance automatically when the tournament starts.\n3. Optional: assign some squires and place a recovery area and a dead spot. Squires drag the wounded and the dead off the lists for you.\n4. Click a flag and pick "Hold tournament".\n\nThe winner becomes champion and crowns a Queen of Love and Beauty. Careful, a joust can kill.\n\nFor the details, the "Guide" button on a flag opens a full guide (also in the mod options). -->
  <RimJoust.IntroLetterText>如何举办比武锦标赛：\n\n1. 在赛道两端各放置一面旗帜A和旗帜B，如果可能，在中间放置赛道栏。\n2. 让殖民者骑上马（Giddy-Up）。锦标赛开始时他们会自动获得比武长枪。\n3. 可选：指派一些侍从，放置恢复区和阵亡点。侍从会为你将伤员和阵亡者拖离赛道。\n4. 点击一面旗帜并选择「举办锦标赛」。\n\n获胜者将成为冠军，并加冕一位边缘世界掌管爱与美的女王。注意，比武可能致命。\n\n详细信息请点击旗帜上的「指南」按钮，会打开完整指南（也可在模组选项中找到）。</RimJoust.IntroLetterText>

