	<!-- EN: Adjust the melee arena radius around this post. The white outline shows the boundary in real time while the post is selected: fighters who cross it are herded back to the center, and the crowd settles just outside it. -->
  <RimJoust.ArenaRadiusDesc>调整此立柱周围的大混战竞技场半径。选中立柱时，白色轮廓会实时显示边界：越过边界的战斗者会被驱赶回中心，观众则聚集在边界外侧。</RimJoust.ArenaRadiusDesc>
	<!-- EN: Arena: auto -->
  <RimJoust.ArenaRadiusAuto>竞技场：自动</RimJoust.ArenaRadiusAuto>
	<!-- EN: Detects the enclosure around the post (railings, walls, doors) and fits the arena to its exact shape, rectangles included. The white outline shows the covered surface while the post is selected. The + and - buttons switch back to circle mode. Needs a closed enclosure: if it leaks somewhere, the button will tell you. -->
  <RimJoust.ArenaRadiusAutoDesc>检测立柱周围的围栏（栏杆、墙壁、门），并将竞技场调整到完全匹配其形状，包括矩形在内。选中立柱时，白色轮廓会显示覆盖的区域。+ 和 - 按钮切换回圆形模式。需要一个封闭的围栏：如果某个地方漏风，按钮会提示你。</RimJoust.ArenaRadiusAutoDesc>
	<!-- EN: The arena is not enclosed (or is wider than {0} cells). Surround the post with railings or walls, with a door to get in, then try again. -->
  <RimJoust.ArenaNotEnclosed>竞技场未封闭（或宽度超过{0}格）。用栏杆或墙壁围绕立柱，并留一道门出入，然后重试。</RimJoust.ArenaNotEnclosed>
	<!-- EN: Arena fitted to the enclosure: {0} cells covered. -->
  <RimJoust.ArenaAutoFit>竞技场已匹配围栏：覆盖{0}格。</RimJoust.ArenaAutoFit>
