	<!-- EN: Character trait effects -->
  <RimJoust.Settings.TraitEffects>人物特性效果</RimJoust.Settings.TraitEffects>
	<!-- EN: When checked, jousters' traits matter: a brawler unhorses harder, a tough one holds the saddle better, a nimble one dodges, a wimp may forfeit, a bloodlust or psychopath knight may try to wound or kill, and post-tournament mood depends on character. -->
  <RimJoust.Settings.TraitEffectsHint>勾选后，比武者的特性会起作用：好斗者更容易将人掀下马，坚韧者更能稳坐马鞍，灵活者会闪避，懦弱者可能认输，嗜血或精神病态者可能试图伤害或杀死对手，锦标赛后的心情取决于人物性格。</RimJoust.Settings.TraitEffectsHint>
