	<!-- EN: Tournament guide -->
  <RimJoust.Guide.Title>比武锦标赛指南</RimJoust.Guide.Title>

	<!-- EN: Laying out the lists -->
  <RimJoust.Guide.ListsTitle>布置赛道</RimJoust.Guide.ListsTitle>
	<!-- EN: A joust is run down the lists: a straight lane between two flags.\n\n- Place a flag A and a flag B (Architect → Misc) at each end, on the same map. Use clearly different colors so you don't mix them up.\n- A list barrier down the middle helps the horses charge straight.\n- You can add a recovery area and a dead spot: squires use them to clear fallen knights.\n\nOnce the lists are laid out you never touch them again. The "Hide marker" button on a flag hides the marker for clean screenshots without breaking anything. -->
  <RimJoust.Guide.ListsBody>比武在赛道上进行：两面旗帜之间的一条直线通道。\n\n- 在同一地图的两端各放置旗帜A和旗帜B（建筑师→杂项）。使用明显不同的颜色以免混淆。\n- 中间的赛道栏有助于马匹直线冲锋。\n- 可以添加恢复区和阵亡点：侍从用它们来清理落马的骑士。\n\n赛道一旦布置好，就无需再动。「隐藏标记」按钮可以隐藏旗帜标记，以便截图干净整洁，且不影响功能。</RimJoust.Guide.ListsBody>

	<!-- EN: The roles: jouster and squire -->
  <RimJoust.Guide.RolesTitle>角色：比武骑士和侍从</RimJoust.Guide.RolesTitle>
	<!-- EN: Select a colonist to see their role buttons.\n\nJouster: you pick who takes part in the tournament. If you mark no one, all your mounted colonists joust by default. Handy to enter only your best.\n\nSquire: during a tournament they pick up fallen knights and carry them to the recovery area, clearing the lists between bouts. They need a recovery area placed so they know where to take them. -->
  <RimJoust.Guide.RolesBody>选择一名殖民者即可看到他们的角色按钮。\n\n比武骑士：你选择谁参加锦标赛。如果不标记任何人，所有骑马的殖民者默认都会参赛。方便只让最好的骑士上场。\n\n侍从：锦标赛期间，他们拾取落马的骑士并抬到恢复区，在比赛间隙清理赛道。他们需要一个已放置的恢复区才能知道送往何处。</RimJoust.Guide.RolesBody>

	<!-- EN: Holding a tournament -->
  <RimJoust.Guide.StartTitle>举办锦标赛</RimJoust.Guide.StartTitle>
	<!-- EN: 1. Mount your jousters (Giddy-Up). Any mount will do.\n2. If you like, enter visitors from other factions as guest knights.\n3. Click a flag and pick "Hold tournament".\n\nThe jousting lance is handed out automatically at the start and taken back at the end: nothing to craft. You need at least two ready jousters to start. -->
  <RimJoust.Guide.StartBody>1. 让比武骑士骑上马（Giddy-Up）。任何坐骑都可以。\n2. 如果愿意，让其他派系的访客作为客座骑士参赛。\n3. 点击一面旗帜并选择「举办锦标赛」。\n\n比武长枪会在开始时自动发放，结束时收回：无需制作。至少需要两名就绪的比武骑士才能开始。</RimJoust.Guide.StartBody>

	<!-- EN: During the tournament -->
  <RimJoust.Guide.DuringTitle>锦标赛期间</RimJoust.Guide.DuringTitle>
	<!-- EN: Knights ride single elimination. On each pass a lance blow can unhorse the other rider: armor, shield, the jouster's skill (a mix of Melee for the strike and Animals for handling the mount) and traits all matter.\n\nOpen the tournament board to follow the current bout, the bracket and the journal. If a guest knight is in a bout, you can wager silver on it.\n\nIt stays dangerous: a blow can badly wound, or even kill. -->
  <RimJoust.Guide.DuringBody>骑士进行单败淘汰赛。每次冲刺中，长枪的冲击可能将对方骑手掀下马：护甲、盾牌、比武者的技能（近战用于攻击，动物用于操控坐骑）以及特性都很重要。\n\n打开锦标赛面板查看当前对决、赛程表和日志。如果某场对决中有客座骑士，你可以下注白银。\n\n这仍然很危险：一击可能造成重伤，甚至死亡。</RimJoust.Guide.DuringBody>

	<!-- EN: Champion and queen -->
  <RimJoust.Guide.AfterTitle>冠军和王后</RimJoust.Guide.AfterTitle>
	<!-- EN: The last one in the saddle is crowned champion. They then name a Queen of Love and Beauty and lay a crown of flowers in her lap.\n\nMost often they crown the one they love. But if they admire someone else far more, it can turn into a scandal, and the passed-over one will not forget. A window tells you who is crowned and why. -->
  <RimJoust.Guide.AfterBody>最后一个留在马鞍上的人被加冕为冠军。然后他们会指定一位边缘世界掌管爱与美的女王，将花冠放在她的膝上。\n\n大多数情况下，他们会加冕自己所爱的人。但如果他们更仰慕另一个人，就可能变成丑闻，被冷落的人不会忘记。一个窗口会告诉你谁被加冕以及原因。</RimJoust.Guide.AfterBody>

	<!-- EN: The grand melee -->
  <RimJoust.Guide.MeleeTitle>大混战</RimJoust.Guide.MeleeTitle>
	<!-- EN: One rule: last one standing.\n\n- Place the melee trophy post (Architect → Misc) in the middle of a clear ground, ideally fenced in with a door.\n- Select the post: the white outline shows the arena boundary. The "Arena: auto" button fits it to your enclosure, the + and - buttons set a circle by hand. Fighters who leave are herded back to the center.\n- Click "Start melee": colonists tagged as jousters dismount, get a blunted tourney mace (their own weapon comes back afterwards), form a circle, and at the horn everyone fights everyone.\n\nDown means out, not dead: maces make bruises, not holes. The "Grand melee damage" slider in the options sets the brutality, and the crowd settles around the arena on its own. -->
  <RimJoust.Guide.MeleeBody>规则只有一条：最后一个站着的人获胜。\n\n- 在空旷场地的中央放置大混战奖杯立柱（建筑师→杂项），最好用围栏围起来并留一道门。\n- 选中立柱：白色轮廓显示竞技场边界。「竞技场：自动」按钮会将竞技场匹配到你的围栏，+ 和 - 按钮手动设置圆形。离开竞技场的战斗者会被赶回中心。\n- 点击「开始大混战」：被标记为比武骑士的殖民者下马，获得一把钝化的比武钉头锤（之后取回自己的武器），围成一圈，号角响起后所有人混战。\n\n倒下意味着出局，而非死亡：钉头锤造成瘀伤，而不是伤口。选项中的「大混战伤害」滑块设置残酷程度，观众会自动聚集在竞技场周围。</RimJoust.Guide.MeleeBody>

	<!-- EN: The archery contest -->
  <RimJoust.Guide.ArcheryTitle>射箭比赛</RimJoust.Guide.ArcheryTitle>
	<!-- EN: - Place the archery line flag, and the butt 10-20 cells across from it, with a clear lane between them. Nothing precious or alive behind the butt: stray arrows do not ask first.\n- Click the flag: colonists tagged as jousters line up, each gets a loaner recurve bow (fairness first, we test the archer, not the arsenal), and shoot three volleys at the butt.\n\nEvery hit counts, with the shooter's name popping above the target. Most hits wins, Shooting skill breaks ties. Black eyes and bad arms cost accuracy, as they should. The crowd watches politely behind the line, never downrange. -->
  <RimJoust.Guide.ArcheryBody>- 放置射箭线旗帜，在对面10-20格处放置靶子，两者之间保持一条畅通的通道。靶子后面不要有任何贵重或活的东西：流矢可不会先打招呼。\n- 点击旗帜：被标记为比武骑士的殖民者列队，每人获得一把借用反曲弓（公平第一，我们考验的是射手，而不是武器库），向靶子射出三轮齐射。\n\n每次命中都算数，射手名字会出现在靶子上方。命中最多者获胜，射击技能打破平局。乌青的眼眶和受伤的手臂会降低精准度，这是理所当然的。观众在线后礼貌观看，绝不下到射程内。</RimJoust.Guide.ArcheryBody>

	<!-- EN: The Grand Tournament -->
  <RimJoust.Guide.GrandTitle>盛大锦标赛</RimJoust.Guide.GrandTitle>
	<!-- EN: Three events back to back, like in the chronicles: the joust, the archery contest, then the grand melee.\n\n- You need the full setup on the same map: the lists (flags A and B), the melee trophy post, the archery line and its butt.\n- Mount your knights and click "Hold a GRAND tournament" on a lists flag. Mounted colonists compete, same as a regular tournament.\n\nEvery event awards points by ranking. The wounded fight on as long as they can stand; anyone down skips the event. At the end, the total crowns the grand champion: a letter with the overall standings, honors, the Queen of Love and Beauty, and a "Grand tournament" entry in the hall of fame. -->
  <RimJoust.Guide.GrandBody>三项活动连续进行，如同编年史中记载：比武、射箭比赛，然后是大混战。\n\n- 你需要在同一张地图上有完整的设施：赛道（旗帜A和B）、大混战奖杯立柱、射箭线和靶子。\n- 让你的骑士骑上马，在赛道旗帜上点击「举办盛大锦标赛」。骑马的殖民者参赛，与普通锦标赛相同。\n\n每项活动按名次给予积分。伤员只要还能站着就会继续战斗；倒下的任何人跳过该活动。最后，总分最高者加冕为总冠军：一封包含总排名、荣誉、边缘世界掌管爱与美的女王，以及名人堂中「盛大锦标赛」词条的信件。</RimJoust.Guide.GrandBody>

	<!-- EN: Settings and danger -->
  <RimJoust.Guide.SafetyTitle>设置与危险度</RimJoust.Guide.SafetyTitle>
	<!-- EN: In the mod options you can set lance damage, unhorse chance, dangerous hit risk, fall damage, grand melee damage and the cooldown between tournaments.\n\nTrait effects (brawler, tough, nimble, wimp, bloodlust, psychopath...) can be turned on or off.\n\nJousting uses no skill of its own: it leans on your Melee (the lance strike) and your Animals (handling the mount). The melee is pure Melee, and the archery contest pure Shooting. To make better champions, train all of it, at the quintain or in tournaments. -->
  <RimJoust.Guide.SafetyBody>在模组选项中，你可以设置长枪伤害、落马几率、危险命中风险、坠落伤害、大混战伤害和锦标赛冷却时间。\n\n特性效果（好斗者、坚韧者、灵活者、懦弱者、嗜血者、精神病态者……）可以开启或关闭。\n\n比武没有独立的技能：它依赖于你的近战（长枪攻击）和动物（操控坐骑）。大混战纯粹考验近战，射箭比赛纯粹考验射击。要培养更好的比武骑士，可以在训练假人练习或参加锦标赛来训练所有相关技能。</RimJoust.Guide.SafetyBody>

